<!--meta {"lead": "An alert explains a condition that affects part of the page, and stays until it no longer applies: you're offline, some details could not load, check the highlighted field.", "description": "Inline alerts in four tones, page banners, alerts with actions and dismissible alerts, in both themes.", "pills": ["Icon + title + text", "Status: stable"], "variants": "inline alert (info, success, warning, danger); page banner; with actions; dismissible; error summary", "states": "default, link hover, link focus, dismiss hover, dismiss focus, persistent", "sources": ["pages/booking-request/offline", "pages/style-detail/partial", "pages/sign-in/invalid", "dialogs/cancel-appointment/failed", "pages/style-gallery/offline"]} -->
<section class="ds-section" id="overview"><h2><a href="#overview">Overview</a></h2>
  <p>Use an alert when a message belongs to the page, or to one region of it, and must stay visible while it is true: "You're offline", "Some details are unavailable", "We couldn't save this change". Use a <a href="toast.html">toast</a> for passing feedback about an action, an <a href="inline-message.html">inline message</a> for one field, and an <a href="empty-state.html">empty state</a> when the whole region failed to load.</p>
  <ul>
    <li><b>Info</b>: context that helps ("Prices are estimates until Nia confirms").</li>
    <li><b>Success</b>: a lasting confirmation on the page ("Your changes are saved").</li>
    <li><b>Warning</b>: something limits what people can do ("You're offline. Connect before sending.").</li>
    <li><b>Danger</b>: something failed or must be fixed ("We couldn't save this change", the form error summary).</li>
    <li><b>Banner</b>: full-width, under the top bar, for conditions that affect the whole app (offline, maintenance).</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="anatomy"><h2><a href="#anatomy">Anatomy</a></h2>
  <div class="ds-anatomy">
    <figure class="ds-anatomy__figure">
      <div class="alert alert--warning" style="width: 100%;">{{icon:warning}}<div><p class="alert__title">Some details are unavailable</p><p>Reviews could not load. Nia's services and prices are up to date.</p><div class="alert__actions"><a class="link link--inherit" href="../../mocks/pages/style-detail/default.html">Retry reviews</a></div></div><button class="close" type="button" aria-label="Dismiss: Some details are unavailable">{{icon:close|icon--sm}}</button></div>
      <span class="ds-callout" style="left: 4%; top: 22%;" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
      <span class="ds-callout" style="left: 30%; top: 16%;" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
      <span class="ds-callout" style="left: 52%; top: 44%;" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
      <span class="ds-callout" style="left: 26%; top: 74%;" aria-hidden="true">4</span>
      <span class="ds-callout" style="left: 92%; top: 20%;" aria-hidden="true">5</span>
      <span class="ds-callout" style="left: 1%; top: 74%;" aria-hidden="true">6</span>
    </figure>
    <ol class="ds-anatomy__list">
      <li><div><b>Icon</b><small>20px, the tone's <code>--color-*-icon</code>; info, check-circle, warning or alert-circle.</small></div></li>
      <li><div><b>Title</b><small><code>.alert__title</code>, 16px semibold; the condition in a few words.</small></div></li>
      <li><div><b>Text</b><small>One or two sentences: what it means and what still works.</small></div></li>
      <li><div><b>Actions (optional)</b><small>Up to two links or text buttons, inheriting the tone colour.</small></div></li>
      <li><div><b>Dismiss (optional)</b><small>24px close button; only for alerts that may be ignored.</small></div></li>
      <li><div><b>Container</b><small>Tinted background, 1px tone border, 4px leading edge, <code>--radius-md</code>, 16px padding.</small></div></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="variants"><h2><a href="#variants">Variants</a></h2>
  {{example:[stack]The four tones, each with icon, title and text.}}
<div class="alert">{{icon:info}}<div><p class="alert__title">Prices are estimates</p><p>Nia confirms the final price and time when she accepts your request.</p></div></div>
<div class="alert alert--success">{{icon:check-circle}}<div><p class="alert__title">Your changes are saved</p><p>Braiders will use your new phone number, 416-555-0148.</p></div></div>
<div class="alert alert--warning">{{icon:warning}}<div><p class="alert__title">You’re offline</p><p>Your details remain here. Connect before sending.</p></div></div>
<div class="alert alert--danger">{{icon:alert-circle}}<div><p class="alert__title">We couldn’t save this change</p><p>Your details remain here. Please try again.</p></div></div>
  {{/example}}
  <h3>With actions and dismissible</h3>
  {{example:[stack]Actions inherit the tone colour; dismiss only what may safely be ignored.}}
<div class="alert alert--warning">{{icon:warning}}<div><p class="alert__title">Some details are unavailable</p><p>Reviews could not load.</p><div class="alert__actions"><a class="link link--inherit" href="../../mocks/pages/style-detail/default.html">Retry reviews</a></div></div></div>
<div class="alert">{{icon:info}}<div><p class="alert__title">New: request a change</p><p>You can now ask Nia for a different time from your appointment.</p></div><button class="close" type="button" aria-label="Dismiss: New: request a change">{{icon:close|icon--sm}}</button></div>
  {{/example}}
  <h3>Error summary</h3>
  {{example:[stack]Shown above a form after a failed submit; it takes focus and links each error to its field.}}
<div class="alert alert--danger form-summary" tabindex="-1" role="group" aria-labelledby="example-summary-title">{{icon:alert-circle}}<div><p class="alert__title" id="example-summary-title">Check the highlighted field</p><ul><li><a class="link link--inherit" href="#example-email">Enter a valid email address</a></li></ul></div></div>
<div class="field"><label class="field__label" for="example-email">Email</label><input class="input" id="example-email" type="email" value="maya.chen@example" aria-invalid="true" aria-describedby="example-email-error"><span class="field__error" id="example-email-error">Enter a valid email address, like name@example.com.</span></div>
  {{/example}}
  <h3>Page banner</h3>
  {{example:[stack]Full-bleed under the top bar; no rounded corners or leading edge.}}
<div class="alert alert--warning banner" role="status">{{icon:wifi-off}}<div><p class="alert__title">You’re offline</p><p>Saved appointment details are shown. Requests need a connection.</p></div></div>
  {{/example}}
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="sizes" data-na="Alerts have one size; they span their container. The banner is the full-width variant."><h2><a href="#sizes">Sizes</a></h2></section>

<section class="ds-section" id="states"><h2><a href="#states">States</a></h2>
  <p>The alert itself is not interactive. Its link and dismiss button have states, forced here with <code>data-state</code>.</p>
  <div class="ds-matrix"><table>
    <thead><tr><th scope="col">Tone</th><th scope="col">Default</th><th scope="col">Link hover</th><th scope="col">Link focus</th><th scope="col">Dismiss focus</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><th scope="row">Info</th><td><div class="alert">{{icon:info}}<div><p class="alert__title">Prices are estimates</p><div class="alert__actions"><a class="link link--inherit" href="../../mocks/pages/style-detail/default.html">See what changes a price</a></div></div></div></td><td><div class="alert">{{icon:info}}<div><p class="alert__title">Prices are estimates</p><div class="alert__actions"><a class="link link--inherit" href="../../mocks/pages/style-detail/default.html" data-state="hover">See what changes a price</a></div></div></div></td><td><div class="alert">{{icon:info}}<div><p class="alert__title">Prices are estimates</p><div class="alert__actions"><a class="link link--inherit" href="../../mocks/pages/style-detail/default.html" data-state="focus">See what changes a price</a></div></div></div></td><td><div class="alert">{{icon:info}}<div><p class="alert__title">Prices are estimates</p></div><button class="close" type="button" aria-label="Dismiss: Prices are estimates" data-state="focus">{{icon:close|icon--sm}}</button></div></td></tr>
      <tr><th scope="row">Success</th><td><div class="alert alert--success">{{icon:check-circle}}<div><p class="alert__title">Your changes are saved</p><div class="alert__actions"><a class="link link--inherit" href="../../mocks/pages/account-settings/default.html">Back to settings</a></div></div></div></td><td><div class="alert alert--success">{{icon:check-circle}}<div><p class="alert__title">Your changes are saved</p><div class="alert__actions"><a class="link link--inherit" href="../../mocks/pages/account-settings/default.html" data-state="hover">Back to settings</a></div></div></div></td><td><div class="alert alert--success">{{icon:check-circle}}<div><p class="alert__title">Your changes are saved</p><div class="alert__actions"><a class="link link--inherit" href="../../mocks/pages/account-settings/default.html" data-state="focus">Back to settings</a></div></div></div></td><td><div class="alert alert--success">{{icon:check-circle}}<div><p class="alert__title">Your changes are saved</p></div><button class="close" type="button" aria-label="Dismiss: Your changes are saved" data-state="focus">{{icon:close|icon--sm}}</button></div></td></tr>
      <tr><th scope="row">Warning</th><td><div class="alert alert--warning">{{icon:warning}}<div><p class="alert__title">Some details are unavailable</p><div class="alert__actions"><a class="link link--inherit" href="../../mocks/pages/style-detail/default.html">Retry reviews</a></div></div></div></td><td><div class="alert alert--warning">{{icon:warning}}<div><p class="alert__title">Some details are unavailable</p><div class="alert__actions"><a class="link link--inherit" href="../../mocks/pages/style-detail/default.html" data-state="hover">Retry reviews</a></div></div></div></td><td><div class="alert alert--warning">{{icon:warning}}<div><p class="alert__title">Some details are unavailable</p><div class="alert__actions"><a class="link link--inherit" href="../../mocks/pages/style-detail/default.html" data-state="focus">Retry reviews</a></div></div></div></td><td>Not dismissible while it applies.</td></tr>
      <tr><th scope="row">Danger</th><td><div class="alert alert--danger">{{icon:alert-circle}}<div><p class="alert__title">We couldn’t save this change</p><div class="alert__actions"><button type="button" class="btn btn--link btn--sm">Try again</button></div></div></div></td><td><div class="alert alert--danger">{{icon:alert-circle}}<div><p class="alert__title">We couldn’t save this change</p><div class="alert__actions"><button type="button" class="btn btn--link btn--sm" data-state="hover">Try again</button></div></div></div></td><td><div class="alert alert--danger">{{icon:alert-circle}}<div><p class="alert__title">We couldn’t save this change</p><div class="alert__actions"><button type="button" class="btn btn--link btn--sm" data-state="focus">Try again</button></div></div></div></td><td>Not dismissible; it clears on success.</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table></div>
  <h3>Both themes</h3>
  {{themes:stack}}<div class="alert">{{icon:info}}<div><p class="alert__title">Prices are estimates</p><p>Nia confirms the final price.</p></div></div><div class="alert alert--success">{{icon:check-circle}}<div><p class="alert__title">Your changes are saved</p></div></div><div class="alert alert--warning">{{icon:warning}}<div><p class="alert__title">You’re offline</p><p>Connect before sending.</p></div></div><div class="alert alert--danger">{{icon:alert-circle}}<div><p class="alert__title">We couldn’t save this change</p></div></div>{{/themes}}
  <ul>
    <li><b>Persistent</b> is the default: warning and danger alerts stay until the condition ends (back online, saved).</li>
    <li><b>Dismissed</b> alerts are removed from the DOM and remembered for the session; focus moves to the next focusable element in the region.</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="responsive"><h2><a href="#responsive">Responsive behaviour</a></h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Alerts fill their container at every width; icon and close stay top-aligned while the text wraps.</li>
    <li>Actions wrap below the text on phones; at 360px two short actions still fit on one line.</li>
    <li>Banners centre their content and wrap title and text onto separate lines below 640px; padding follows <code>--layout-margin</code>.</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="theming"><h2><a href="#theming">Theming</a></h2>
  <p>Component tokens <code>--alert-bg</code>, <code>--alert-fg</code>, <code>--alert-border</code> and <code>--alert-icon</code> map to the tone's <code>--color-*-bg</code>, <code>-fg</code>, <code>-border</code> and <code>-icon</code>. In dark mode the background becomes a deep tint (amber-950, red-950) with light text and a mid-tone edge.</p>
  <pre><code>/* A neutral note with the alert layout */
.alert--neutral { --alert-bg: var(--color-bg-subtle); --alert-fg: var(--color-fg-default); --alert-border: var(--color-border-default); --alert-icon: var(--color-fg-muted); }</code></pre>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="accessibility"><h2><a href="#accessibility">Accessibility</a></h2>
  <h3>Role and pattern</h3>
  <p>Alerts present when the page loads need no role; they are part of the content. An alert inserted after load uses <code>role="status"</code> (warning, info, success) or <code>role="alert"</code> (danger); see the <a href="https://www.w3.org/WAI/ARIA/apg/patterns/alert/">APG Alert pattern</a>. Status is icon + title + text, never colour alone.</p>
  <h3>Keyboard</h3>
  <table class="ds-table ds-keys"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Key</th><th scope="col">Action</th></tr></thead><tbody>
    <tr><td><kbd>Tab</kbd> / <kbd>Shift</kbd>+<kbd>Tab</kbd></td><td>Reaches links, actions and the dismiss button in order.</td></tr>
    <tr><td><kbd>Enter</kbd> / <kbd>Space</kbd></td><td>Follows a link or activates an action or dismiss.</td></tr>
  </tbody></table>
  <h3>Focus</h3>
  <p>The error summary takes focus on a failed submit (<code>tabindex="-1"</code>, then <code>focus()</code>), and each item links to its field. It is a <code>role="group"</code> named by its title (<code>aria-labelledby</code>), not <code>role="alert"</code>: the focus move already announces it, and a live role would announce it twice. Other alerts never take focus. Links inside use the shared ring.</p>
  <h3>Labelling</h3>
  <p>The title names the condition; the icon is <code>aria-hidden</code>. The dismiss button names the alert ("Dismiss: Some details are unavailable").</p>
  <h3>Contrast</h3>
  <div class="ds-example__canvas ds-example__canvas--stack" style="padding: 0; gap: var(--space-2);">
    {{pair:Info text|--color-info-fg|--color-info-bg|4.5}}
    {{pair:Success text|--color-success-fg|--color-success-bg|4.5}}
    {{pair:Warning text|--color-warning-fg|--color-warning-bg|4.5}}
    {{pair:Danger text|--color-danger-fg|--color-danger-bg|4.5}}
    {{pair:Warning icon|--color-warning-icon|--color-warning-bg|3}}
    {{pair:Danger icon|--color-danger-icon|--color-danger-bg|3}}
  </div>
  <h3>Motion</h3>
  <p>None. Alerts appear in place; they do not slide or pulse.</p>
  <h3>Touch</h3>
  <p>The dismiss button is 24px with the alert's padding around it; action links are at least 24px tall.</p>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="content"><h2><a href="#content">Content</a></h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Title: the condition, not a judgement: "You’re offline", "Some details are unavailable", "We couldn’t save this change".</li>
    <li>Text: what it means and what is safe: "Your details remain here. Connect before sending."</li>
    <li>Actions name the outcome: "Retry reviews", "Try again", never "Click here".</li>
    <li>Error summaries say how many fields need attention and list each one in the field's words.</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="do-dont"><h2><a href="#do-dont">Do and don't</a></h2>
  <div class="ds-dodont">
    <figure class="ds-do"><div class="ds-example__canvas"><div class="alert alert--warning">{{icon:warning}}<div><p class="alert__title">You’re offline</p><p>Your details remain here. Connect before sending.</p></div></div></div><figcaption>Icon, title and text: the condition is clear without colour.</figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="ds-dont"><div class="ds-example__canvas"><div class="alert alert--warning"><div><strong>You’re offline.</strong> Your details remain here. Connect before sending.</div></div></div><figcaption>No icon and a bold run-in instead of a title, as in the first offline and partial mocks; tone depends on colour.</figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="ds-do"><div class="ds-example__canvas"><div class="alert alert--danger form-summary">{{icon:alert-circle}}<div><p class="alert__title">Check the highlighted field</p><ul><li><a href="#example-email">Enter a valid email address</a></li></ul></div></div></div><figcaption>The error summary links each problem to its field.</figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="ds-dont"><div class="ds-example__canvas"><div class="alert alert--danger form-summary"><div><strong>Check the highlighted field</strong><p>Correct the information below and try again.</p></div></div></div><figcaption>A summary with no links (the first invalid form mocks) makes people hunt for the field.</figcaption></figure>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="tokens"><h2><a href="#tokens">Tokens</a></h2>
  <div class="ds-table-wrap"><table class="ds-table">
    <thead><tr><th scope="col">Part</th><th scope="col">Token</th><th scope="col">Light</th><th scope="col">Dark</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      {{tok:Info background / text|--color-info-bg|--color-info-fg}}
      {{tok:Info border / icon|--color-info-border|--color-info-icon}}
      {{tok:Success background / text|--color-success-bg|--color-success-fg}}
      {{tok:Success border / icon|--color-success-border|--color-success-icon}}
      {{tok:Warning background / text|--color-warning-bg|--color-warning-fg}}
      {{tok:Warning border / icon|--color-warning-border|--color-warning-icon}}
      {{tok:Danger background / text|--color-danger-bg|--color-danger-fg}}
      {{tok:Danger border / icon|--color-danger-border|--color-danger-icon}}
      {{tok:Leading edge|--border-width-accent}}
      {{tok:Padding / gap|--space-4|--space-3}}
      {{tok:Shape|--radius-md}}
      {{tok:Title font|--text-label}}
    </tbody>
  </table></div>
  <p>Component tokens: <code>--alert-bg</code>, <code>--alert-fg</code>, <code>--alert-border</code>, <code>--alert-icon</code>.</p>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="code"><h2><a href="#code">Code</a></h2>
  <pre><code>&lt;div class="alert alert--warning" role="status"&gt;
  &lt;svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24"&gt;…&lt;/svg&gt;
  &lt;div&gt;
    &lt;p class="alert__title"&gt;Some details are unavailable&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Reviews could not load.&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;div class="alert__actions"&gt;&lt;a href="…"&gt;Retry reviews&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="alert alert--danger form-summary" tabindex="-1" role="group" aria-labelledby="summary-title"&gt;…&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="alert alert--warning banner" role="status"&gt;…&lt;/div&gt;</code></pre>
  <table class="ds-table"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Class / attribute</th><th scope="col">Effect</th></tr></thead><tbody>
    <tr><td><code>.alert</code></td><td>Base: info tone.</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>.alert--success</code> <code>.alert--warning</code> <code>.alert--danger</code></td><td>Tone.</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>.alert__title</code> <code>.alert__body</code> <code>.alert__actions</code></td><td>Content parts; a plain <code>&lt;div&gt;</code> after the icon also works as the body.</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>.alert .close</code></td><td>Dismiss button; needs <code>aria-label</code>.</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>.banner</code></td><td>Full-width page banner.</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>.form-summary</code></td><td>Error summary: 4px edge, list of links; give it <code>tabindex="-1"</code> and focus it.</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>role="status"</code> / <code>role="alert"</code></td><td>Only on alerts inserted after load.</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>.alert__actions:empty</code></td><td>Hidden when nothing is projected.</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>--link-inherit-font-weight</code></td><td>Set by <code>.alert</code> to semibold, read by <code>.link--inherit</code> links inside it.</td></tr>
  </tbody></table>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="sources"><h2><a href="#sources">Sources</a></h2>
  <p>Extracted from these mocks:</p>
  <ul>
    {{mock:pages/booking-request/offline|offline warning above the form}}
    {{mock:pages/style-detail/partial|partial data with a retry link}}
    {{mock:pages/sign-in/invalid|error summary}}
    {{mock:dialogs/cancel-appointment/failed|danger alert in a dialog}}
    {{mock:pages/style-gallery/offline|offline banner under the top bar}}
  </ul>
  <p>Drift fixed during extraction: offline and partial alerts had no icon and used a bold run-in instead of <code>.alert__title</code> (system: icon + title + text); the error summary had no links to the invalid fields and no list (system: one link per error); alerts inserted after an action carried no live role (system: <code>role="status"</code> or <code>role="alert"</code>); the confirm-state warning used generic copy ("This action updates your account") instead of naming the consequence.</p>
</section>
